HB0268 People's parking act.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Singh and Filer and Senator(s)
Hutchings
AN ACT relating to cities and towns; requiring a vote of qualified electors to
approve the use of paid parking meters or zones by cities and towns; and
providing for an effective date.
